    rdfs:seeAlso """INF TSI: 4.2.9.2
PRM TSI: 4.2.2.11
OPE TSI: 2.3.7 of Appendix D2""" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :platformObjParameter ;
    ns1:term_status "stable" ;
    skos:scopeNote """Values included in the list are taken from PRM and INF TSIs including Specific Cases. They are the values which are mandatory for the design of the platform at the respective part of the network. They are not real values measured at real platforms.
Platform dimensions are always related to one neighbouring track at a time.
So, if two tracks are along a platform, this platform should be divided into two or more â€˜RINF platformsâ€™ to have precise description of each."""@en .

